@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "SmartCartView\n(UI Main)" as MainUI
participant "QuestionnaireAdminDialog\n(UI Dialog)" as Dialog
participant "TagFieldService\n(Backend)" as Service
participant "TagFieldRepository\n(DB)" as DB

Admin -> MainUI : Navigate to Smart Cart view
activate MainUI
Note over MainUI: Detect Admin Role and display\nexclusive "Edit Survey" button

Admin -> MainUI : Click "Edit Survey" button
MainUI -> Dialog ** : Open QuestionnaireAdminDialog form
activate Dialog

Admin -> Dialog : Modify categories/tags & click "Save"
Dialog -> Service : saveTagField(tagField)
activate Service

Service -> DB : save(tagField)
activate DB
DB --> Service : confirm save success in MongoDB
deactivate DB

Service --> Dialog : return success confirmation
deactivate Service

Note over Dialog: Close dialog form
Dialog --> MainUI : trigger survey layout refresh
deactivate Dialog

MainUI -> Admin : Display updated dynamic questionnaire
deactivate MainUI
@enduml